t or products based on the user's browsing history. Cookies that have not yet been classified. Cookie report Name Provider / Domain Expires Description clickedFolder www.isa.au.dk Session urm_se soeg.kb.dk Session esctx-OasV10qUaN0 .login.microsoftonline.com Session OH.SID m365.cloud.microsoft Session bachelor-application-initial-lang .minansoegning.au.dk 1 year __Secure-typo3nonce_pmyJoTrasMnO9YxL_eVzaw inano.medarbejdere.au.dk Session esctx-9kQ4yoZHlkM .login.microsoftonline.com Session eventvaerk_session event.au.dk 1 hour 59 minutes ahoy_visitor www.powr.io 1 year 1 month VXZCPXNY mit.au.dk Session esctx-IEaOixO5w8 .login.microsoftonline.com Session esctx-EeHPW0ZrGwY .login.microsoftonline.com Session oiosaml-fragment stadssb.au.dk Session __Secure-typo3nonce_EPVu7YV_2sBZCdWlwo43EQ kandidat.au.dk Session QueueITAccepted-SDFrts345E-V3_audkprod2026 minansoegning.au.dk 1 day VXZCPXNY eddiprod.au.dk Session esctx-s8rchb0T81g .login.microsoftonline.com Session esctx-LGkoxLDsyqs .login.microsoftonline.com Session esctx-NfWJXy4uzU .login.microsoftonline.com Session idpCode soeg.kb.dk Session selvbetjening stadssb.au.dk Session esctx-b6ApW7aoGco .login.microsoftonline.com Session .AspNetCore.Correlation.Pvuw0yJaPDeqZEdvW7Gq8j907kN0wcBaVaoG-CGDpWo m365.cloud.microsoft 15 minutes 2 seconds esctx-G9jXokPQ0a4 .login.microsoftonline.com Session esctx-mYFnGRohQmk .login.microsoftonline.com Session esctx-gnWXAYDvHoo .login.microsoftonline.com Session esctx-wX1PASl2Cs .login.microsoftonline.com Session SimpleSAMLSessionID2 signon.kb.dk Session urm_st soeg.kb.dk Session __Secure-typo3nonce__D7bgJdfsVpWEuSKer29MA law.medarbejdere.au.dk Session OH.FLID m365.cloud.microsoft 1 year 2 seconds __Secure-YNID .youtube.com 5 months 4 weeks esctx-CZhb7qae7xk .login.microsoftonline.com Session esctx-n21tW9enEM .login.microsoftonline.com Session esctx-ttMzXUEsPIA .login.microsoftonline.com Session institute soeg.kb.dk Session esctx-UR1VVTLCo30 .login.microsoftonline.com Session OH.DCAffinit