ontent provided by Panopto. It ensures that preferences like volume level, video resolution, and playback speed are remembered on subsequent visits. _cfuvid .elfsight.com Session This cookie is used for purposes of tracking users across sessions to optimize user experience by maintaining session consistency and providing personalized services. googtrans .iorad.com Session This cookie is used to store the user's language preference and to deliver content in the user's preferred language, ensuring a better user experience. mid Meta Platform Inc. .instagram.com 1 year 1 month This is an Instagram cookie that enables social media functionality within the site. li_alerts LinkedIn www.linkedin.com 1 year This cookie is used to manage subscription service alerts in order to notify a user about job alerts or relevant notifications related to their career interests. au-vacancies-last-visit .au.dk Session This script/cookie records the date+time of the visitor's last visit and displays it upon their return, but can also be hidden. lang .linkedin.com Session There are many different types of cookies associated with this name, and a more detailed look at how it is used on a particular website is generally recommended. However, in most cases it will likely be used to store language preferences, potentially to serve up content in the stored language. brw Airtable .airtable.com 1 year This cookie is used to track user behavior and interaction to improve user experience and service functionality. _cfuvid .pure.au.dk Session This cookie is used for purposes of tracking users across sessions to optimize user experience by maintaining session consistency and providing personalized services. elfsight_viewed_recently Elfsight core.service.elfsight.com 14 seconds This cookie is used to record which items a user has viewed recently on the website to provide an enhanced user experience by showing related content or products based on the user's browsing history. Cookies that have not yet be