lways handled by the same server in the cluster. XSRF-TOKEN event.au.dk 1 hour 59 minutes This cookie is written to help with site security in preventing Cross-Site Request Forgery attacks. li_gc LinkedIn Corporation .linkedin.com 5 months 4 weeks Used to store guest consent to the use of cookies for non-essential purposes x-ms-gateway-slice Microsoft Corporation login.microsoftonline.com Session Identifies a gateway for load balancing. CFTOKEN Adobe Inc. eddiprod.au.dk Session Cookie set by Adobe ColdFusion applications. Used in conjunction with CFID this cookie helps to uniquely identify a client device (browser) to enable the site to maintain user session variables. How those are used are specific to the site. CFTOKEN contains a random number to identify the client. brwConsent .airtable.com 5 minutes This cookie is used to record the user's consent to the use of cookies on the website, ensuring compliance with the website's privacy policy by remembering the user's preferences and consent state regarding cookies. CFTOKEN Adobe Inc. mit.au.dk Session Cookie set by Adobe ColdFusion applications. Used in conjunction with CFID this cookie helps to uniquely identify a client device (browser) to enable the site to maintain user session variables. How those are used are specific to the site. CFTOKEN contains a random number to identify the client. OptanonAlertBoxClosed OneTrust LLC .pure.au.dk 1 year This cookie is set by websites using certain versions of the cookie law compliance solution from OneTrust. It is set after visitors have seen a cookie information notice and in some cases only when they actively close the notice down. It enables the website not to show the message more than once to a user. The cookie has a one year lifespan and contains no personal information. PHPSESSID PHP.net internationalstaff.app3.geckobooking.dk Session Cookie generated by applications based on the PHP language. This is a general purpose identifier used to maintain user session variables. It is normally a random generated number, how it is used can be specific to the site, but a good example is maintaining a logged-in status for a user between pages. ARRAffinity Microsoft Corporation .ofn.au.dk Session This cookie is set by websites run on the Windows Azure cloud platform. It is used for load balancing to make sure the visitor page requests are routed to the same server in any browsing session. JSESSIONID Oracle Corporation .www.linkedin.com Session General purpose platform session cookie, used by sites written in JSP. Usually used to maintain an anonymous user session by the server. ASPSESSIONIDSQQCSQRC webforms.au.dk Session This cookie name is generally associated with use as a general purpose platform session cookie, used by sites written with Microsoft ASP based technologies. The structure of the cookie name is a common root - ASPSESSIONID, followed by a series of unique letters. It is usually used to maintain an anonymised user session by the server. __RequestVerificationToken Microsoft Corporation forms.cloud.microsoft Session This is an anti-forgery cookie set by web applications built using ASP.NET MVC technologies. It is designed to stop unauthorised posting of content to a website, known as Cross-Site Request Forgery. It holds no information about the user and is destroyed on closing the browser. ARRAffinitySameSite Microsoft Corporation .mitstudie.au.dk Session When using Microsoft Azure as a hosting platform and enabling load balancing, this cookie ensures that  requests from one visitor browsing session are always handled by the same server in the cluster. __Secure-typo3nonce_5BBMWw-Vqa1kCJ-0ZdXjSg www.au.dk Session ASPSESSIONIDQQGRARBC www.isa.au.dk Session This cookie name is generally associated with use as a general purpose platform session cookie, used by sites written with Microsoft ASP based technologies. The structure of the cookie name is a common root - ASPSESSIONID, followed by a series of unique letters. It is usually us